1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,260
Every day, millions of
parcels leave your warehouses.

2
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:07,210
Most hold exactly what
the customer ordered.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:12,510
Some don't. And the customer only
finds out after the parcel is opened.

4
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:21,090
Counterfeit and pirated goods worth 467
billion dollars crossed borders in 2021.

5
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:24,470
That is 2.3 percent of world imports.

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,700
The cost that matters
most is harder to measure.

7
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:32,446
About two in three shoppers
say they would lose trust in a

8
00:00:32,296 --> 00:00:34,350
marketplace after buying a fake.

9
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:40,690
TrueChain gives every high-value item
its own record, one you can check.

10
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:43,330
The record starts at the factory.

11
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:45,550
The brand registers the item.

12
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:50,260
Suppliers and assemblers add parts,
inspections and certificates.

13
00:00:50,270 --> 00:00:53,070
Distributors and retailers log the sale.

14
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:58,450
Anyone can scan a QR code and read
that history, with no sign-in needed.

15
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,760
Every item, a record you can check.

16
00:01:01,770 --> 00:01:04,370
Let's build trust into every order.

